==English==
[[Image:Small.knife.for.women.jpg|thumb|right|150px|a penknife]]

===Etymology===
Originally a small knife used for cutting the [[nib]] of a [[quill]] pen.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|penknives}}

# A small [[pocketknife]]; a small [[knife]] with a [[blade]] which folds into the hand. Penknives often incorporate other tools such as [[corkscrews]], and are generally smaller than [[pocketknife|pocketknives]] as a group.

